---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Cookie policy - Chalet Husky"
  description="Cookie policy for Chalet Husky website, premium rental in Les 2 Alpes."
>
  <section class="legal-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Cookie policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: January 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. What is a cookie?</h2>
        <p>A cookie is a small text file placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit a website. It allows the site to remember your actions or preferences (e.g. language) for a certain period.</p>

        <h2>2. Cookies used on this site</h2>
        <p>The website <strong>chalet-les2alpes.fr</strong> uses the following cookies:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Strictly necessary cookies</strong>: essential for the site to function (e.g. remembering your cookie choices). They cannot be disabled.</li>
          <li><strong>Preference cookies</strong>: allow us to remember your settings (language, display).</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong>: if we use an analytics tool (e.g. Google Analytics), these cookies help us understand how visitors use the site, in an anonymous way.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Retention period</h2>
        <p>Session cookies are deleted when you close your browser. Persistent cookies are kept for a limited period (e.g. 12 or 13 months depending on type), then deleted.</p>

        <h2>4. Managing cookies</h2>
        <p>You can at any time choose to refuse or accept non-essential cookies:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Via your browser settings (often under "Privacy" or "Cookies").</li>
          <li>By refusing non-essential cookies on your first visit if a consent banner is displayed.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Blocking certain cookies may affect how the site works (e.g. language or display).</p>

        <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
        <p>Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify and erase your personal data. For any questions about our cookies or your data: <a href="mailto:chalet.husky.2alpes@gmail.com">chalet.husky.2alpes@gmail.com</a>.</p>

        <p><a href="/en/mentions-legales">Back to legal notice</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-header {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    padding: var(--spacing-lg) 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-blue-night);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }
  .legal-updated {
    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }
  .legal-content {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-blue-night);
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    color: var(--color-blue-night);
  }
  .legal-content h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .legal-content p, .legal-content ul {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }
  .legal-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .legal-content a:hover {
    color: var(--color-sapin);
  }
</style>
